      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "description": [
        "&6Welcome to Amber & Arcana!&r",
        "",
        "Gather wood, stone, food, and a bed. Build a safe shelter and use JEI to look up recipes.",
        "",
        "&bUseful commands:&r /sethome base, /home base, and /delhome base. FTB Essentials provides these commands; the default limit is one home.",
        "",
        "",
        "&eItem requirement:&r Carry the listed items in your inventory while this quest is unlocked. Items are detected and kept; placed blocks must be picked up for detection.",
        "The build instructions above are practical goals; inventory detection does not verify a shelter, chunk claim, running machine, or train schedule.",
        "",
        "Rewards: one random material bundle and one random provision bundle, plus the listed XP. Common supplies have higher odds; each reward can be claimed once."
      ],
